{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "zonvo-rest-api-v1",
    "name": "Zonvo AI REST API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for Zonvo AI AI-powered bulk calling platform.\n\n## Authentication\n\nAll endpoints require an API key. Add your key to the collection variables:\n1. Click on the collection name\n2. Go to Variables tab\n3. Set `api_key` to your API key\n\n## Getting Started\n\n1. Generate an API key from Settings > Developer in the Zonvo AI dashboard\n2. Set the `base_url` variable to your instance URL\n3. Set your `api_key`\n4. Start making requests!\n\n## What's new (v2.1.0, Sept 2026)\n\nFolders for **Callbacks** (single, bulk, cancel by externalRef), **Leads**, **Appointments** and **Do-not-call**, plus call outcomes (`GET /calls/outcomes`, `POST /calls/:id/outcome`, `outcome` filter on `GET /calls`) and scheduled calls (`POST /calls` with `scheduledAt`).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{api_key}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "https://app.zonvo.tech",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "api_key",
      "value": "your-api-key-here",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
